          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The dataset consists of 138,193 observations from 39 countries, including 22 European countries, 6 Asian countries, 5 countries from the Middle East and North Africa, 2 Latin American countries and 4\r\nother Western countries. \r\n\r\nData sources: World Values Survey and European Values Survey (WVS/EVS), Solt’s World Income Inequality Database (SWIID, Solt 2016), the World Inequality Database (WID) and the World Bank."
